OL,3,GNEWSAWales plans to ban steel pylons as
OL,4,Agovernment launches consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government has announced
OL,7,Fplans to ban the use of traditional
OL,8,Fsteel pylons to support electricity
OL,9,Flines over which it has control.
OL,11,FPlaid Cymru ministers favour burying
OL,12,Fcables underground instead.
OL,14,FPlans for a network of pylons in the
OL,15,FTowy Valley have faced a fierce local
OL,16,Fbacklash with local Plaid politicians
OL,17,Fspeaking out against the proposals.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
