OL,3,GNEWSAWales plans to ban steel pylons as
OL,4,Agovernment launches consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company behind the plans, Green Gen
OL,7,FCymru, said it welcomed the
OL,8,Fconsultation and that it supported
OL,9,Fusing "the right infrastructure in the
OL,10,Fright place".
